body:
I guess the issue caused by forgetting reset time of `PlaybackInfo`.

If we reset time to zero, the new animation will play from front.

```diff
diff --git a/scene/animation/animation_blend_space_2d.cpp b/scene/animation/animation_blend_space_2d.cpp
index 62ba7edd4e..45221542fc 100644
--- a/scene/animation/animation_blend_space_2d.cpp
+++ b/scene/animation/animation_blend_space_2d.cpp
@@ -567,7 +567,10 @@ AnimationNode::NodeTimeInfo AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D::_process(const AnimationM
                                pi.weight = 0;
                                from = blend_node(blend_points[cur_closest].node, blend_points[cur_closest].name, pi, FILTER_IGNORE, true, true);
                                pi.time = from.position;
+                       } else {
+                               pi.time = 0;
                        }
                        pi.seeked = true;
                        pi.weight = 1.0;
                        mind = blend_node(blend_points[new_closest].node, blend_points[new_closest].name, pi, FILTER_IGNORE, true, p_test_only);

```

But I am afraid that resolving this issue may lead to compatibility issues. Maybe there are some people depending on current behaviors.

